Photorealistic industrial user-interface asset: one single round transport push button, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, filling about 70 percent of the image, isolated on a pure flat black background. Outer ring: thick forged dark steel with a coarse knurled grip edge, worn and bead-blasted. A thin ring of molten orange light glows between the steel ring and the face, like hot metal. Face: completely blank matte black powder-coated steel, very slightly domed, with faint fine scratches. Heavy, raw, engineered, like a control on foundry machinery. Product photography, crisp focus, perfectly circular and symmetrical. Absolutely no symbol, no icon, no arrow, no text, no letters. One object only, no watermark.
